  CellName: Chum
  Description: 'Barrier - intensity 4 of Chum: sixteen crusted shoals out by the membrane, two crystals
    and fifteen grazers racing you. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u). No
    environment prefab - the reef (16 shoals, 2,832 prisms of 7 u, 1,808 of them shielded
    crust) is laid by ChumController. 15 tameable tadpoles graze it outside the nucleus; 2
    omni crystals respawn inside it (the scene''s CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the
    full arena (4,889 prisms, 1,141,090 volume). Authored by
    Tools/Build/author_chum_assets.py - re-run it rather than hand-editing.'
